{"description":"\nUse `<ImageCard />` to present a card with an image on top, a title and\nsupporting content below.\n\n```js\n---\ntype: example\n---\n<ImageCard\n  title=\"Card Title\"\n  src={placeholderImage(250, 250)}\n  alt=\"A gray placeholder square\"\n>\n  <Text color=\"secondary\" variant=\"content\">Content goes here.</Text>\n</ImageCard>\n```\n\n### Breakpoints\n\nCard has 3 visual designs based on its size, these are applied automatically\n\n```js\n---\ntype: example\n---\n<Flex direction=\"column\" gap=\"medium\">\n  <div style={{ width: '15rem', maxWidth: '100%' }}>\n    <ImageCard\n      title=\"Small\"\n      src={placeholderImage(600, 340)}\n      alt=\"A gray placeholder\"\n    >\n      <Text color=\"secondary\" variant=\"content\">\n        Narrower than the medium breakpoint.\n      </Text>\n    </ImageCard>\n  </div>\n  <div style={{ width: '30rem', maxWidth: '100%' }}>\n    <ImageCard\n      title=\"Medium\"\n      src={placeholderImage(600, 340)}\n      alt=\"A gray placeholder\"\n    >\n      <Text color=\"secondary\" variant=\"content\">\n        Between the two breakpoints.\n      </Text>\n    </ImageCard>\n  </div>\n  <div style={{ width: '45rem', maxWidth: '100%' }}>\n    <ImageCard\n      title=\"Large\"\n      src={placeholderImage(600, 340)}\n      alt=\"A gray placeholder\"\n    >\n      <Text color=\"secondary\" variant=\"content\">\n        Wider than the large breakpoint.\n      </Text>\n    </ImageCard>\n  </div>\n</Flex>\n```\n","displayName":"ImageCard","methods":[],"props":{"children":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"ReactNode"},"description":"The content to be rendered inside the Card"},"title":{"required":true,"tsType":{"name":"string"},"description":"The title string of the card. Renders as InstUI's <Heading>"},"titleLevel":{"required":false,"tsType":{"name":"union","raw":"HeadingLevel<'h1' | 'h2' | 'h3' | 'h4' | 'h5' | 'h6'> | 'reset'","elements":[{"name":"union","raw":"'h1' | 'h2' | 'h3' | 'h4' | 'h5' | 'h6'","elements":[{"name":"literal","value":"'h1'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'h2'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'h3'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'h4'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'h5'"},{"name":"literal","value":"'h6'"}]},{"name":"literal","value":"'reset'"}]},"description":"Heading is rendered as h3 by default. Rewrite this if necessary.","defaultValue":{"value":"'h3'","computed":false}},"src":{"required":true,"tsType":{"name":"string"},"description":"The src string of the img."},"alt":{"required":true,"tsType":{"name":"string"},"description":"The alt string of the img."}},"category":"components/Cards","relativePath":"packages/ui-card/src/ImageCard/v1/index.tsx","extension":".tsx","srcPath":"packages/ui-card/src/ImageCard/v1/index.tsx","srcUrl":"https://github.com/instructure/instructure-ui/tree/master/packages/ui-card/src/ImageCard/v1/index.tsx","packageName":"@instructure/ui-card","requirePath":"@instructure/ui-card/lib/ImageCard/v1/index","requireStr":"require('/home/runner/work/instructure-ui/instructure-ui/packages/ui-card/src/ImageCard/v1/index.tsx').default","esPath":"@instructure/ui-card/es/ImageCard/v1/index","id":"ImageCard","title":"ImageCard","componentVersion":"v1","componentDirName":"ImageCard"}